tps://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274195418943488127309.png/mqhQoxeo6rZS3JRDuIrNmZji7Xf77DfcaMwoHmjMKB4\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274184437731328185974.png/ytmAmVe_6QB8L61Ock59Usu3RgbMIf6wrPc19qz3NfY\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（《末代皇帝》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053277714758242304573498.jpeg/cLCWdDm7Pwqw8AECCdpxqZaUckbg2npLcJh6XHCYelw\"/><figcaption>示意圖（《末代皇帝》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274186958639104370628.png/tJ8iAEECqn4ww9BU0V3wrHJrCBJwusd0rJVZ1ayVWdU\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274189542461440465283.png/FJb30CaDQ7HXiaV4LsI93LYdzI22izuPYHlhC2B5YQs\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274191987871744910542.png/GcKUn9JbKK-1Q_E5qVPx9wcZbNYlq6Au-hW0r_oVtK8\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053274194663968768895203.png/jGElGscXo9dhAhnUY8xF5ekebgzYdQ1CdioM-HYqDPg\"/><figcaption>古代皇帝孩子超多，為何一定要由嫡長子繼位？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：古代太監被閹割怎麼上廁所？不能站也不能蹲，「真實解決方法」太沒尊嚴令人心酸】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T15:22:47.364973+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1881,"images":36,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}